msgid "Auto Save"
msgstr "Garda automática"

#. +> trunk6
#: src/views/widgets/SettingsDialog.qml:151
#, kde-format
msgid "Download files without asking."
msgstr "Descargar os ficheiros sen preguntar."

#. +> trunk6
#: src/views/widgets/SettingsDialog.qml:179
#, kde-format
msgid "Accelerated 2D Canvas"
msgstr "Lenzo 2D acelerado"

#. +> trunk6
#: src/views/widgets/SettingsDialog.qml:180
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Specifies whether the HTML 5 2D canvas should be an OpenGL framebuffer. This m"
"akes many painting operations faster, but slows down pixel access."
msgstr ""
"Indica se o lenzo 2D de HTML 5 debería ser un búfer de fotogramas de OpenGL. I"
"sto acelera as operacións de pintar, pero lentifica o acceso aos píxeles."

#. +> trunk6
#: src/views/widgets/SettingsDialog.qml:193
#, kde-format
msgid "PDF Viewer"
msgstr "Visor de PDF"

#. +> trunk6
#: src/views/widgets/SettingsDialog.qml:194
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"PDF documents will be opened in the internal PDF viewer instead of being downl"
"oaded."
msgstr "Os documentos PDF abriranse no visor interno en vez de descargarse."

#. +> trunk6
#: src/views/widgets/SettingsDialog.qml:207
#, kde-format
msgid "Plugins Enabled"
msgstr "Activar os complementos"

#. +> trunk6
#: src/views/widgets/SettingsDialog.qml:208
#, kde-format
msgid "Enables support for Pepper plugins, such as the Flash player."
msgstr ""
"Activa a compatibilidade con complementos de Pepper, como o reprodutor de Flas"
"h."

#. +> trunk6
#: src/views/widgets/SettingsDialog.qml:224
#: src/views/widgets/SettingsDialog.qml:241
#, kde-format
msgid "JavaScript"
msgstr "JavaScript"

#. +> trunk6
#: src/views/widgets/SettingsDialog.qml:225
#, kde-format
msgid "Configure JavaScript behaviour."
msgstr "Configurar o comportamento de JavaScript."

#. +> trunk6
#: src/views/widgets/SettingsDialog.qml:247
#, kde-format
msgid "Javascript Enabled"
msgstr "Activar JavaScript"

#. +> trunk6
#: src/views/widgets/SettingsDialog.qml:248
#, kde-format
msgid "Enables the running of JavaScript programs."
msgstr "Activa a execución de programas de JavaScript."

#. +> trunk6
#: src/views/widgets/SettingsDialog.qml:261
#, kde-format
msgid "Javascript Can Access Clipboard"
msgstr "JavaScript pode acceder ao portapapeis"

#. +> trunk6
#: src/views/widgets/SettingsDialog.qml:262
#, kde-format
msgid "Allows JavaScript programs to read from or write to the clipboard."
msgstr "Permite aos programas de JavaScript ler e escribir no portapapeis."

#. +> trunk6
#: src/views/widgets/SettingsDialog.qml:275
#, kde-format
msgid "Javascript Can Paste"
msgstr "JavaScript pode pegar"

#. +> trunk6
#: src/views/widgets/SettingsDialog.qml:276
#, kde-format
msgid "Enables JavaScript execCommand(paste)."
msgstr "Activa o código JavaScript «execCommand(paste)»."

#. +> trunk6
#: src/views/widgets/SettingsDialog.qml:289
#, kde-format
msgid "Allow Window Activation From JavaScript"
msgstr "Permitir a activación de xanelas desde JavaScript."

#. +> trunk6
#: src/views/widgets/SettingsDialog.qml:290
#, kde-format
msgid "Allows the window.focus() method in JavaScript."
msgstr "Permite o método window.focus() de JavaScript."

#. +> trunk6
#: src/views/widgets/SettingsDialog.qml:307
#: src/views/widgets/SettingsDialog.qml:323
#, kde-format
msgid "Security & Privacy"
msgstr "Seguridade e privacidade"

#. +> trunk6
#: src/views/widgets/SettingsDialog.qml:308
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Configure the look and feel of the editor. The settings are applied globally"
msgstr "Configurar o xeito do editor. A configuración aplícase globalmente."

#. +> trunk6
#: src/views/widgets/SettingsDialog.qml:329
#, kde-format
msgid "Allow Geolocation On Insecure Origins"
msgstr "Permitir a xeolocalización en orixes inseguras."

#. +> trunk6
#: src/views/widgets/SettingsDialog.qml:330
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Only secure origins such as HTTPS have been able to request Geolocation featur"
"es."
msgstr ""
"Só as orixes seguras, como as que usan HTTPS, poden actualmente solicitar func"
"ionalidades de xeolocalización."

#. +> trunk6
#: src/views/widgets/SettingsDialog.qml:343
#, kde-format
msgid "Allow Running Insecure Content"
msgstr "Permitir executar contido inseguro."

#. +> trunk6
#: src/views/widgets/SettingsDialog.qml:344
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"By default, HTTPS pages cannot run JavaScript, CSS, plugins or web-sockets fro"
"m HTTP URLs."
msgstr ""
"De maneira predeterminada, as páxinas HTTPS non poden executar JavaScript, CSS"
", complementos ou tomas web desde URL que usen HTTP."

#. +> trunk6
#: src/views/widgets/SettingsDialog.qml:358
#, kde-format
msgid "DNS Prefetch Enabled"
msgstr "Activar a obtención anticipada de DNS."

#. +> trunk6
#: src/views/widgets/SettingsDialog.qml:359
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Enables speculative prefetching of DNS records for HTML links before they are "
"activated."
msgstr ""
"Activa a obtención anticipada especulativa de rexistros de DNS para ligazóns H"
"TML antes de que se activen."

#. +> trunk6
#: src/views/widgets/SettingsDialog.qml:372
#, kde-format
msgid "Local Content Can Access File Urls"
msgstr "O contido local pode acceder a URL de ficheiros."

#. +> trunk6
#: src/views/widgets/SettingsDialog.qml:373
#, kde-format
msgid "Allows locally loaded documents to access other local URLs."
msgstr "Permite a documentos cargados localmente acceder a outros URL locais."

#. +> trunk6
#: src/views/widgets/SettingsDialog.qml:386
#, kde-format
msgid "Local Content Can Access Remote Urls"
msgstr "O contido local pode acceder a URL remotos."

#. +> trunk6
#: src/views/widgets/SettingsDialog.qml:387
#, kde-format
msgid "Allows locally loaded documents to access remote URLs."
msgstr "Permite a documentos cargados localmente acceder a URL remotos."

#. +> trunk6
#: src/views/widgets/SettingsDialog.qml:400
#, kde-format
msgid "Local Storage"
msgstr "Almacenamento local."

#. +> trunk6
#: src/views/widgets/SettingsDialog.qml:401
#, kde-format
msgid "Enables support for the HTML 5 local storage feature."
msgstr "Activa a funcionalidade de almacenamento local de HTML 5."

#. +> trunk6
#: src/views/widgets/SettingsDialog.qml:414
#, kde-format
msgid "WebRTC Public Interfaces Only"
msgstr "WebRTC só con interfaces públicas."

#. +> trunk6
#: src/views/widgets/SettingsDialog.qml:415
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Limits WebRTC to public IP addresses only. When disabled WebRTC may also use l"
"ocal network IP addresses, but remote hosts can also see your local network IP"
" address."
msgstr ""
"Limita WebRTC a enderezos IP públicos. Se o desactiva, WebRTC tamén pode usar "
"enderezos IP da rede local, pero os servidores remotos tamén poden ver o ender"
"ezo IP da rede local."
